OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_GymGuide::
	.string "That is CISSY's gym.\p"
	.string "She does not battle challengers.\n"
	.string "She tests them. There is a\l"
	.string "difference, and it catches people\l"
	.string "out.$"

