	.string "The water here is flat in the\n"
	.string "morning and rough by four.\p"
	.string "Challenge her early.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_Beach_Text_Child::
	.string "I can hit a can with my SQUIRTLE\n"
	.string "from four steps away.\p"
	.string "CISSY does it from twenty.$"

